<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#6d3945">
<title>A Mother's Day Letter</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Great+Vibes&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600&display=swap');
:root{--wine:#713d4b;--rose:#b87980;--cream:#f8efdE;--ink:#5d4140;--gold:#b38a62}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;min-height:100%;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#f9eee4}
body{
 min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:28px 16px;
 background:
 radial-gradient(ellipse at 18% 15%,rgba(223,170,157,.25),transparent 35%),
 radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 80%,rgba(125,58,75,.42),transparent 38%),
 linear-gradient(135deg,#382a31 0%,#70434b 48%,#493039 100%);
}
body:before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.15;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.28'/%3E%3C/svg%3E")}
.stage{width:min(100%,760px);position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center}
.kicker{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.36em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e7c9b8;margin-bottom:14px;opacity:.9}
h1{font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,66px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 30px;color:#f8e8d8;text-shadow:0 3px 24px #1e101b66}
.envelope-wrap{height:330px;display:grid;place-items:center;perspective:1200px;transition:height 1s ease}
.envelope{position:relative;width:min(88vw,470px);height:280px;cursor:pointer;filter:drop-shadow(0 24px 26px #1b101b66);transform:translateY(0);transition:transform .8s ease}
.envelope:hover{transform:translateY(-5px)}
.env-back{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e8cbb5,#d5ae9b);border-radius:8px}
.letter-peek{position:absolute;left:6%;right:6%;bottom:12px;height:220px;background:#fbf2df;border-radius:4px;transition:transform 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1);box-shadow:0 3px 12px #54363a33}
.env-front{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d7b39e,#bd8e82);clip-path:polygon(0 0,50% 57%,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);border-radius:8px}
.env-flap{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f0d7c2,#d9b7a3);clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,50% 58%);transform-origin:top;transition:transform .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);z-index:4;filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 2px #805b5140)}
.seal{position:absolute;z-index:5;left:50%;top:55%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#d99ba0,#a65365 70%);border:1px solid #e8bdad;box-shadow:0 4px 12px #71404b66;color:#fff0e7;font-size:28px;transition:opacity .35s,transform .5s}
.tap{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 16px);left:0;right:0;color:#f2d9ca;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.04em;animation:pulse 2.3s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.55;transform:translateY(3px)}}
.open .env-flap{transform:rotateX(180deg);z-index:1}
.open .seal{opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.5)}
.open .letter-peek{transform:translateY(-145px)}
.open .envelope{transform:translateY(80px) scale(.88)}
.open .tap{opacity:0}
.letter-shell{display:none;opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px) scale(.98);transition:opacity 1s ease,transform 1s ease;max-width:660px;margin:0 auto}
.open .letter-shell{display:block}
.letter-shell.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
.paper{position:relative;text-align:left;padding:clamp(28px,6vw,54px) clamp(25px,7vw,66px);color:var(--ink);background:
 radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 10%,#fff9e8 0,transparent 40%),
 radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 90%,#e9d8b9 0,transparent 42%),
 repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(130,96,64,.025) 0,rgba(130,96,64,.025) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 4px),
 #f7eedb;
 border:1px solid #d7bd96;box-shadow:0 18px 50px #1c101a77, inset 0 0 40px #b99b7130}
.paper:before,.paper:after{content:"❦";position:absolute;color:#b28a67;font-size:24px;opacity:.8}
.paper:before{top:12px;left:17px}.paper:after{bottom:12px;right:17px;transform:rotate(180deg)}
.corner{position:absolute;width:32px;height:32px;border-color:#bd9a73;border-style:solid;opacity:.7}
.c1{top:12px;right:12px;border-width:1px 1px 0 0}.c2{bottom:12px;left:12px;border-width:0 0 1px 1px}
.letter-title{font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(20px,4vw,27px);font-weight:600;color:#76504b;margin:0 0 24px}
.letter-body{font-size:clamp(18px,2.6vw,21px);line-height:1.62;white-space:pre-line}
.letter-body p{margin:0 0 16px}
.signature{font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;font-size:36px;color:#a36b70;text-align:right;margin-top:24px}
.footer{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e6c8b8;margin-top:30px}
.heart{position:fixed;top:-30px;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;color:#e6a8ad;opacity:.65;animation:fall linear forwards;text-shadow:0 2px 8px #4d263b55}
@keyframes fall{to{transform:translate3d(var(--drift),110vh,0) rotate(360deg);opacity:0}}
@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:22px 13px}.envelope-wrap{height:290px}.envelope{height:220px}.letter-peek{height:180px}.open .letter-peek{transform:translateY(-110px)}.open .envelope{transform:translateY(65px) scale(.88)}.tap{font-size:17px}.paper{padding-top:42px;padding-bottom:42px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="stage" id="stage">
  <div class="kicker">A little letter, with love</div>
  <h1>My Beautiful and Kind Mrs. Rafiei</h1>
  <section class="envelope-wrap" id="envelopeWrap" aria-label="A sealed letter">
    <div class="envelope" id="envelope" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open the letter">
      <div class="env-back"></div><div class="letter-peek"></div>
      <div class="env-front"></div><div class="env-flap"></div>
      <div class="seal">♡</div>
      <div class="tap">Tap the heart to open your letter</div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="letter-shell" id="letterShell" aria-hidden="true">
    <article class="paper">
      <span class="corner c1"></span><span class="corner c2"></span>
      <h2 class="letter-title">My Beautiful and Kind Mrs. Rafiei,</h2>
      <div class="letter-body">
<p>I hope that when your beautiful eyes fall upon this page and these words, they bring you even the slightest bit of happiness and put a smile on your face.</p>
<p>I truly wish I could have celebrated Mother's Day with you in a different way, by giving you a gift and giving you a hug. Unfortunately, that isn't possible, but I have tried my best to find a special way to wish you a happy Mother's Day.</p>
<p>Without a doubt, you are the kindest, most caring, strongest, most beautiful, and most wonderful mother anyone could ever ask for.</p>
<p>I am certain that your children are proud to have a mother like you.</p>
<p>And I feel incredibly happy and lucky to have someone as extraordinary as you in my life, even if only for a chapter of it.</p>
<p>I love you more than words can express, and from the bottom of my heart, I wish that every single day of your life unfolds in a way that you truly wish for yourself.</p>
<p>Happy Mother's Day!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="signature">With all my love</div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <div class="footer">Made with love · Mother's Day</div>
</main>
<script>
const stage=document.getElementById('stage');
const envelope=document.getElementById('envelope');
const shell=document.getElementById('letterShell');
let opened=false;
const gentleMusic = new Audio("data:audio/mpeg;base64,
